---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Page not found
description: The page you asked for is not on the DFWin International website. Browse the product catalog or request a quote.
permalink: 404.html
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
hideCta: true
---
{#- GitHub Pages serves this file for a missing address at any folder depth, so
    the relative links in the shared layout can point to the wrong place. Two
    safeguards: the links in this page are absolute, and the small style block
    keeps the page readable if site.css does not load. The script then points
    the shared header, footer and stylesheets back at the site root. -#}
<style>
:where(body) { margin: 0; background: #011a39; color: #ffffff; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
:where(a) { color: #ffffff; }
:where(.nf) { max-width: 44rem; padding: 4rem 1.25rem; }
:where(.nf h1) { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.15; }
:where(.nf p) { margin: 0 0 1.5rem; color: #c3d1e4; }
.nf-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
:where(.nf-actions a) { padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; border: 1px solid #ffffff; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; }
</style>
<script>
(function () {
  var root = {{ '/' | abs | json | safe }};
  if (location.href.indexOf(root) !== 0) return;
  var base = document.createElement("base");
  base.href = root;
  document.head.appendChild(base);
  document.body.setAttribute("data-root", root);
  ["href", "src"].forEach(function (attr) {
    document.querySelectorAll("link[" + attr + "], img[" + attr + "]").forEach(function (el) {
      var value = el.getAttribute(attr);
      if (value && !/^([a-z]+:|\/\/|#)/i.test(value)) el.setAttribute(attr, root + value);
    });
  });
})();
</script>
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap nf">
    <h1>We could not find that page</h1>
    <p class="lede">The address may be old or mistyped. The product catalog and the quote form are the two quickest ways to what you need.</p>
    <div class="nf-actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ 'quote.html' | abs }}">Request a quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn--outline" href="{{ 'catalog.html' | abs }}">Browse the catalog</a>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem">Or go to the <a href="{{ '/' | abs }}">home page</a>, or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email.sales }}">{{ site.email.sales }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
